sequenceDiagram
    %% SD3 - Prepare and maintain the items
    %% Stories: 3, 4, 6, 7, 8, 14, 15, 31
    %% Description: The moderator starts a round with a first item, can import more items from a spreadsheet, and adds, edits or deletes items during play; everyone sees the round's items.
    actor M as Moderator
    actor EP as Estimator (person)
    participant G as Game
    participant R as Round
    participant I as Item

    M->>G: start round with a first item [3]
    G->>R: create()
    R->>I: create(text)
    opt import or paste items from a spreadsheet [14, 15]
        M->>R: import items
        R->>I: create(text) for each row
    end
    R-->>M: all items of the round [4]
    R-->>EP: all items of the round [31]
    alt add an item during play [6]
        M->>R: add item
        R->>I: create(text)
    else edit an item [7]
        M->>R: edit item text
        R->>I: setText(text)
    else delete an item [8]
        M->>R: delete item
        R->>I: delete()
    end
